    {
      "id": "fc5d8c56-75ea-4036-a2ae-988563a18434",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -96,
        -400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#D3B1D0",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcdd Form: Upload Any File\n\n### Purpose\nCollects the user's project name, email address, and document or image through an n8n form.\n\n### How It Works\n- Collects the user's project name.\n- Collects and validates the user's email address.\n- Allows the user to upload a document or image.\n- Requires the configured fields before submission.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nProvides a simple interface for users to submit files without accessing the n8n editor.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "da2455e6-8f91-472e-a9a5-a1d651be658a",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        240,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#D3BEB1",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udd17 Create Public File Link\n\n### Purpose\nUploads the submitted document or image and generates a URL that can be used to create a QR code.\n\n### How It Works\n- Receives the uploaded file from the form node.\n- Uploads the file using the UploadToURL integration.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nThe QR code requires a destination URL that users can open after scanning it.\n\n### Setup Notes\n- Configure the required UploadToURL integration.\n- Ensure the destination URL remains accessible for the intended period.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cca8c785-0974-45fe-bc35-0e27d907518a",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        576,
        -368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#C3DAD2",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udd32 Generate QR Code\n\n### Purpose\nConverts the uploaded file's public URL into a QR code image.\n\n### How It Works\n- Receives the file URL from the previous node.\n- Generates a QR code representing the destination URL.\n- Produces the QR code as a PNG image.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nAllows users to access documents and images by scanning a QR code instead of manually entering a URL.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7b8d66a6-c4ea-451a-9df7-1519236c2eff",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        912,
        -368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#D1D3B1",
        "width": 336,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udce7 Email QR Code to User\n\n### Purpose\nSends the generated QR code to the email address provided in the original form submission.\n\n### How It Works\n- Creates an HTML email explaining that the QR code is ready.\n- Attaches the generated QR code image.\n- Includes a direct link to the uploaded file.\n\n### Output\n- Email sent to the user\n- QR code image attachment\n- Direct link to the uploaded file\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e6ff54c8-6ac0-4f1f-acb0-124e1ab9c4ec",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -96,
        -688
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#E0C2D1",
        "width": 688,
        "height": 224,
        "content": "## \ud83d\ude80 Instant Document & Image to QR Code Maker\n\n### Workflow Overview\n1. The user submits a project name, email address, and document or image through an n8n form.\n2. The uploaded file is sent to UploadToURL to generate a file URL.\n3. The QR Toolkit node converts the URL into a PNG QR code.\n4. The Gmail node prepares a personalized email using the submitted details.\n5. The generated QR code is attached to the email along with a direct file link.\n6. The user receives a ready-to-use QR code that can be scanned to access the uploaded file."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
